    {
      "subId": "4007508",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to everyone",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "400750801"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "400750801": {
            "id": "400750801",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Oh, we're back again!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400750802"
            ]
          },
          "400750802": {
            "id": "400750802",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Xinyan",
            "text": "So uh, Mona, is that adventurer... dead now?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400750803"
            ]
          },
          "400750803": {
            "id": "400750803",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Mona",
            "text": "...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400750804"
            ]
          },
          "400750804": {
            "id": "400750804",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Mona",
            "text": "That was the only time I ever saw him. And that was more than three years ago, which means... he's no longer alive.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400750805"
            ]
          },
          "400750805": {
            "id": "400750805",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "But isn't there still a chance that he's alive? You know, like maybe you just made a mistake?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400750806"
            ]
          },
          "400750806": {
            "id": "400750806",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "But that's not fair.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400750807"
            ]
          },
          "400750807": {
            "id": "400750807",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Mona",
            "text": "You can't call it divination if you reject anything bad and believe the good unreservedly. That's just self-deception.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400750808"
            ]
          },
          "400750808": {
            "id": "400750808",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Mona",
            "text": "Of course, casually performing divination for fun might be a different matter, but in my field of expertise, there's no room for lies.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400750809"
            ]
          },
          "400750809": {
            "id": "400750809",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Mona",
            "text": "To contradict my own reading would be a blasphemy against astrology.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400750810"
            ]
          },
          "400750810": {
            "id": "400750810",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Kaedehara Kazuha",
            "text": "Cruel, but truthful. Such is fate.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400750811"
            ]
          },
          "400750811": {
            "id": "400750811",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Mona",
            "text": "I don't usually say things like this, but while we're on the topic, I really hope you don't confuse astrology with those fortune stick peddlers that you see along the streets.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400750812"
            ]
          },
          "400750812": {
            "id": "400750812",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Mona",
            "text": "Astrology does not exist to please. We astrologists are here to verify and witness the truths of this world.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400750813"
            ]
          },
          "400750813": {
            "id": "400750813",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Mona",
            "text": "...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400750814"
            ]
          },
          "400750814": {
            "id": "400750814",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Mona",
            "text": "Which is why astrology is a disdained profession! It is a mighty art, but unfortunately one that annoys people nonetheless.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400750815"
            ]
          },
          "400750815": {
            "id": "400750815",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Fischl",
            "text": "Why dost thou protest so much, Lady Megistus? Thou seemst not to be the sort with whom one would be loathe to be associated.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400750816"
            ]
          },
          "400750816": {
            "id": "400750816",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Oz",
            "text": "What mein Fräulein means is that she's glad to be friends with you.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400750817"
            ]
          },
          "400750817": {
            "id": "400750817",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Fischl",
            "text": "No! That was not what I said!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400750818"
            ]
          },
          "400750818": {
            "id": "400750818",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Fischl",
            "text": "Whatever has gotten into you, Oz! You misinterpret my utterances with an increasingly alarming frequency!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400750819"
            ]
          },
          "400750819": {
            "id": "400750819",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Oz",
            "text": "Oh my, why could that be? Perhaps I have been concerned that mein Fräulein could offend her friends and have been attempting to soften her words?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400750820"
            ]
          },
          "400750820": {
            "id": "400750820",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Xinyan",
            "text": "Although you're the only astrologist I know, you've left an awesome impression on me. You're not annoying at all!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400750821"
            ]
          },
          "400750821": {
            "id": "400750821",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Xinyan",
            "text": "Those who go snooping around for secrets, yet ignore whatever they don't wanna hear? They're the ones who should reflect on themselves. Knowing your fate doesn't come cheap.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400750822"
            ]
          },
          "400750822": {
            "id": "400750822",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Kaedehara Kazuha",
            "text": "If one could simply avoid fate with just a few words, no one would have to endure the pain of parting. Mona, don't take others' comments to heart.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400750823"
            ]
          },
          "400750823": {
            "id": "400750823",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Kaedehara Kazuha",
            "text": "Follow your heart and never forget what's right.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400750824"
            ]
          },
          "400750824": {
            "id": "400750824",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Mona",
            "text": "I—I don't need comforting, thank you very much! I'm very tough, you know!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400750825"
            ]
          },
          "400750825": {
            "id": "400750825",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Then why are your ears red?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400750826"
            ]
          },
          "400750826": {
            "id": "400750826",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Mona",
            "text": "Oh, uh...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400750827"
            ]
          },
          "400750827": {
            "id": "400750827",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Mona",
            "text": "Well, then... Umm...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400750828"
            ]
          },
          "400750828": {
            "id": "400750828",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Mona",
            "text": "Th—Thank you.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400750829"
            ]
          },
          "400750829": {
            "id": "400750829",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Fischl",
            "text": "What dost thou say? Speak up, and offer your highest reverence and blessings to the Prinzessin.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400750830"
            ]
          },
          "400750830": {
            "id": "400750830",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Xinyan",
            "text": "Okay, okay, Your Highness... Instead of making a scene, why don't you go collect the other fragments in the new location reflected by the pool? We can't enter the mirage without 'em.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400750831"
            ]
          },
          "400750831": {
            "id": "400750831",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Oz",
            "text": "Mein Fräulein, you are the only one with eyes sharp enough to locate the secrets.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400750832"
            ]
          },
          "400750832": {
            "id": "400750832",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Fischl",
            "text": "If that's the case, very well, I shall proceed to the beach...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400750833"
            ]
          },
          "400750833": {
            "id": "400750833",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Xinyan",
            "text": "Let's go, Mona.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400750834"
            ]
          },
          "400750834": {
            "id": "400750834",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Mona",
            "text": "Oh, okay! Coming!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400750835"
            ]
          },
          "400750835": {
            "id": "400750835",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Kaedehara Kazuha",
            "text": "...Haha."
          }
        }
      }
    },
